{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2021-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1623801600, "end_date": 1624406399, "month_true_total": 1501, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:48:42 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "94192454", "author": {"steamid": "76561198104750879", "personaname": "Airiyaza", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Airiyaza/", "num_games_owned": 816, "num_reviews": 64, "playtime_forever": 2615, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1505, "last_played": 1700841330, "avatar": "f2eca8d585fdc2d0d5e7abd8c22437506a89642c"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you like FPS and Roguelite. this one is for you", "timestamp_created": 1624406332, "timestamp_updated": 1624406332, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94191425", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043888514", "personaname": "Buckshot Bert", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/buckshotbert/", "num_games_owned": 142, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 6176, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3889, "last_played": 1669432856, "avatar": "bda78d47ec0e6040cd4c4516f699c05d50ea70db"}, "language": "english", "review": "it good", "timestamp_created": 1624404440, "timestamp_updated": 1624404440, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94191002", "author": {"steamid": "76561198263774352", "personaname": "Knight Quill", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198263774352/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 657, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 594, "last_played": 1624407722, "avatar": "6dfa6553feacb7788df2cc725f971e5320ef36f9"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm usually not one for rogue-likes, but the gameplay of Gunfire Reborn definitely caught my eye. From the first time I hopped in to play alone at Level 1 I was already hooked. While there isn't any amount of crazy variance of levels, guns, or enemies, the way that they switch up each round/match/whatever is enough to keep me hooked and keep wanting to come back and play again. It's also a lot more fun playing with a team, and the variance of the perks and weapons that will be available and when you will get them during each round spices it up enough to justify playing through again and again. I'm hoping that the devs will continue to add more content to the game, but for the price and the amount of fun I've had in the game I'd recommend it for almost anyone.", "timestamp_created": 1624403745, "timestamp_updated": 1624403745, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94190037", "author": {"steamid": "76561198809186094", "personaname": "Wiwiolka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198809186094/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1718, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1139, "last_played": 1756835250, "avatar": "f1b245d0b554d645c857bf3fdb5fa0128df9cfc4"}, "language": "english", "review": "pog game pewpew amaright", "timestamp_created": 1624401866, "timestamp_up